{"itemid":"1135491","languages":{"english":{"app[content][earlyaccess][why]":"Early Access gives us a chance to build a community and receive feedback the game needs to reach its best version. Seeing what players love and hate will help us shape the final release.","app[content][earlyaccess][how_long]":"I'm planning for the Early Access stage to take no longer than 6 months. Regular updates till we create a complete experience that isn't trying to be everything at once.\r\nI aim to create a polished neat little product that shines and goes down smooth.\r\nThat said if there's interest for it post full release I'd love to push some updates.","app[content][earlyaccess][full_version]":"Planned updates in mind including extra content like extra items, characters, endings and new environments to play in, as well as polish and balance of course.\r\nBut mostly we're excited about seeing what the community enjoys about the game and expanding from there. ","app[content][earlyaccess][current_state]":"The game is in a fully playable state with an established core loop that won't change in the future. We have already implemented over 100 trinkets, spells and snacks, multiple playable characters, special dice effects and meta progression.\r\nSee About This Game for more info!\r\n\r\nThe game might have bugs that we haven't found, it's missing some characters, trinkets, challenge runs and other features that will modify and expand the game. ","app[content][earlyaccess][pricing]":"Yes. But I want to keep it on cheaper side, it'll most likely get a raise by a few bucks.","app[content][earlyaccess][community]":"I'm curious to see how a wider audience interacts with the game. I wanna know how they feel about it. Looking forward to seeing players opinions on strong and weak sides of the game.\r\n\r\nHaving a Discord community with a place to share different builds, discuss updates and current meta will be fun. We don't have a hired community manager so players will have to put up with speaking directly to me, Franek, and with the coder, Max.","app[content][about]":"[p]You're smart. You roll few dice, get few points. It's enough. Time to bank... but wait-[\/p][p]You're smarter. One more roll. Perfect, double your points. Just one more.[\/p][p]You're a genius. You keep winning. You're the chosen one. The dice love you. One more roll and you take it all.[\/p][p]You're stupid. You lose it all. You swear they're judging you.[\/p][p]\r\nRestart.\r\n[\/p][p]▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬[\/p][h2 align=&quot;center&quot;][img src=&quot;{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}\/extras\/item_showcase&quot;][\/img][\/h2][h2 align=&quot;center&quot;][b]Dice Have No Eyes is a dice-rolling Balatro-like fever dream about greed management.[\/b][\/h2][p][\/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;] Every roll carries a chance for glory.[\/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]But every roll carries a risk of bust. [\/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]Improve and swap your dice with each cleared level.   [\/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;]Collect trinkets and discover broken synergies.   \r\n[\/p][p align=&quot;center&quot;] [\/p][p][img src=&quot;{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}\/extras\/die_eat_hargow&quot;][\/img][\/p][p]  [\/p][h2]Features:[\/h2][list][*][p]100+ trinkets [\/p][\/*][*][p]40+ spells and snacks[\/p][\/*][*][p]RNG powered by God n' Fate engine[\/p][\/*][*][p]Magic dice effects[\/p][\/*][*][p]13 companions with unique powers[\/p][\/*][*][p]Pretty decent art[\/p][\/*][*][p]Dice with no eyes whatsoever[\/p][\/*][*][p]Advanced tickle mechanic technology[\/p][\/*][*][p]Night mode for your poor tired eyes[\/p][\/*][*][p]5 dreamy worlds to play in[\/p][\/*][*][p]An entity claiming to be God[\/p][\/*][*][p]Music sourced straight from starving indie musicians[\/p][\/*][\/list][p] \r\n[img src=&quot;{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}\/extras\/steam_chase_die&quot;][\/img]\r\nMade by two guys \r\n[\/p]","app[content][short_description]":"★ Surreal dice-rolling roguelike about luck and greed ★\r\nFeed your dice dumplings, collect game bending trinkets, roll too much and lose it all.\r\nOr get lucky, unlock King Fetus, meet God and you might just wake up.\r\n","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"Vista","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"i3 2GHz","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"512MB VRAM","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"Yes","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][osversion]":"Windows 10","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][processor]":"i5 3GHz","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][graphics]":"1GB VRAM","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][soundcard]":"Yes"},"french":{"app[content][earlyaccess][why]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][how_long]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][full_version]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][current_state]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][pricing]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][community]":"","app[content][about]":"","app[content][short_description]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][soundcard]":""},"italian":{"app[content][earlyaccess][why]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][how_long]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][full_version]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][current_state]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][pricing]":"","app[content][earlyaccess][community]":"","app[content][about]":"","app[content][short_description]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][processor]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][graphics]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][soundcard]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][osversion]":"","app[content][sysreqs][windows][rec][processor]":"","app[conten